            "height": 576,
            "thumbnail_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2118688143134318593/img/jzJ89J_s7rtMUgeB.jpg",
            "type": "video",
            "url": "https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2118688143134318593/vid/avc1/1024x576/kO87VPkp_VpwpuCy.mp4?tag=29",
            "width": 1024
          }
        ],
        "name": "DogeDesigner",
        "text": "Starlink helped save six lives in the Atlantic. \n\nThe Estonian yacht Cekritito was taking on water off Spain. Captain Madis Rallmann used Starlink to send a distress message to volunteer rescuers in Estonia. They passed it to maritime authorities, and a Spanish Coast Guard helicopter flew out to the crew.\n\nOne by one, all six sailors were lifted from their life raft and flown safely to Vigo.\n\nThe yacht sank hours later.",
        "url": "https://x.com/cb_doge/status/2118688185706238031",
        "verified": true,
        "verified_type": "individual"
      },
      "retweet": null,
