        "name": "X Freeze",
        "text": "Elon Musk on the life cycle of civilizations:\n\n“You do tend to see the same patterns… civilizations go through a life cycle like an organism\nJust like a human: zygote, fetus, baby, toddler, teenager… eventually it gets old and dies\nThe civilizations go through a life cycle\nNo civilization will last forever”\n\nThe only question is how long we can delay the inevitable",
