      "type": "转发",
      "type_label": "转发",
      "text": "Cybertruck was an incredible technology development platform and lives on through Cybercab. Thanks to everyone who contributed to making the future looking like the future\n\nAs well to the community of owners whose adventures I've enjoyed and will continue to follow ❤️",
      "quote": {
